# NOTE: api/index.cjs is intentionally COMMITTED to the repo (not gitignored).
# Vercel's @vercel/node scanner only detects files committed to git — files
# generated during the build but gitignored are invisible to it. We commit the
# pre-built CJS bundle so Vercel reliably detects the serverless function at
# /api. The build script regenerates this file on every build, so it stays
# in sync with server.ts.
